  "hooks": [
    "6:1 is the hinge. From there on the Lamanites are the righteous ones, and they stay that way.",
    "The Gadianton band forms in ch. 2 and never dies. It outlives the book and the nation.",
    "Two Nephite prophets can't get a hearing at home; a Lamanite on a wall can.",
    "Samuel starts a five-year clock in ch. 14. The book ends with a year still on it (16:24).",
    "Mormon stops narrating once (ch. 12), to say why the cycle keeps coming back around."
  ],
